  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p>原创 <span>Unique&nbsp;Research</span> <span>2026-07-13 19:00</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">上海</span></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=5dd97453&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2F1ZTGteQRfa2bSGMFEqmI2CegG6vibtFJHFUUrkdqbqPFviagDU0FJJmKpcLRsuiaY8ANJ8Zicl6jULOXf8xiaFolmPIRBHE8aNagPiaicYj8Gpd9Ss%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\"></p>\n  <div data-role=\"outer\" label=\"edit by 135editor\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\">\n   <div data-role=\"paragraph\">\n    <p nodeleaf=\"\"><mp-common-miniprogram class=\"js_uneditable custom_select_card mp_miniprogram_iframe\" data-pluginname=\"insertminiprogram\" data-miniprogram-path=\"pages/index/index\" data-miniprogram-nickname=\"非凡大赏\" data-miniprogram-avatar=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/9uY129ibIgfAXJg62xZrpctibGKfPOGofXiaLe9D6HR9wQAwjwXE1j09Oq38rEtoXqVzK4rtN5HjiakUahJk4I12Zg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;wxfrom=200\" data-miniprogram-title=\"非凡大赏\" data-miniprogram-imageurl=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/1ZTGteQRfa3RCSIsibXiaYC377cVp3OFAHjCY01ic0NbgSjcItW2QQbyIgosiahTYdRsd7De7iawI2kp4NzkicRyPAf6aDEhJ3rrAKMADtpR4THl8/0?wx_fmt=jpeg\" data-miniprogram-type=\"card\" data-miniprogram-servicetype=\"0\" data-miniprogram-appid=\"wx7c841ea20a5121e7\" data-miniprogram-applink=\"#小程序://非凡大赏/ZCmriDEqSmzkv7E\" data-miniprogram-imageurlback=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2F1ZTGteQRfa2Xeb7epap8xdTBkYoA3Q7AtF2QrguyjBpM148ib4hYjD0LicfNMmABl39kjlhLicHS63NKP5KPxN9K73NqV4vN1Cw5GgrXcVmCYw%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg%26from%3Dappmsg\" data-miniprogram-cropperinfo=\"%7B%22c%22%3A%7B%22x%22%3A0%2C%22y%22%3A0%2C%22x2%22%3A144%2C%22y2%22%3A115.2%2C%22w%22%3A144%2C%22h%22%3A115.2%7D%7D\"></mp-common-miniprogram></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin:0 auto;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\n    <div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fafafa 0%,#f0f0f0 100%);padding:50px 24px 40px;text-align:center;border-bottom:2px solid #000000;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:3px;color:#d4a574;margin-bottom:20px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">2026非凡大赏·上海</span></strong></p>\n     <h1 style=\"font-size:31px;line-height:1.32;margin:0 0 20px;color:#1a1a1a;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-family:'Songti SC','SimSun',serif;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">出发前请收好这份 2026 非凡大赏 · 上海 AI 商业峰会参会指南</span></strong></h1>\n     <p style=\"font-size:17px;color:#666;margin:0;line-height:1.65;font-style:italic;\"><span leaf=\"\">\"把这篇指南先收藏好，出发前再看一遍。\"</span></p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"padding:0 24px 40px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"text-align:justify;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:#333;margin:0 0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">距离 2026 非凡大赏 · 上海 AI 商业峰会开幕只剩最后两天。</span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:justify;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:#333;margin:0 0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">如果你已经报名，接下来最值得准备的，不只是行程：怎么最快到场、签到时要打开什么、现场有哪些值得用好的功能和福利——这篇一次说清。</span></p>\n     <div style=\"margin:48px 0 24px;\">\n      <p style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;\"></p>\n      <h2 style=\"font-size:24px;color:#1a1a1a;margin:0;font-family:'Songti SC','SimSun',serif;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">先记住这三个信息</span></strong></h2>\n      <p></p>\n     </div>\n     <p style=\"text-align:justify;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:#333;margin:0 0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">时间：7 月 15 日（周三）— 7 月 16 日（周四），每天 9:00—17:00</span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:justify;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:#333;margin:0 0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">地点：上海漕河泾万丽酒店二层宴会厅</span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:justify;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:#333;margin:0 0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">地址：上海市徐汇区田林路 397 号</span></p>\n     <p class=\"channels_iframe_wrp\" nodeleaf=\"\"><mp-common-videosnap class=\"js_uneditable custom_select_card channels_live_iframe\" data-pluginname=\"mpvideosnap\" data-headimgurl=\"https://wx.qlogo.cn/finderhead/ciaIftfPzwlqicOJrtxnwYONRbqbPYRu3uHp5YZFCC8j4wjXcEglaal8wDGnEBYEwIichrg8SniaBx8/0\" data-username=\"v2_060000231003b20faec8c4e08b11c7d3cc07e832b077b1cbb5cdd67ccd635db942f6280130ef@finder\" data-nickname=\"非凡产研\" data-desc=\"将在07月15日 09:30 直播\" data-type=\"live\" data-intro=\"AI 落地峰会｜2026非凡大赏\" data-noticeid=\"finderlivenotice-v2_060000231003b20faec8c4e08b11c7d3cc07e832b077b1cbb5cdd67ccd635db942f6280130ef@finder-1782798983343758-1103042358\" data-status=\"0\"></mp-common-videosnap></p>\n     <p class=\"channels_iframe_wrp\" nodeleaf=\"\"><mp-common-videosnap class=\"js_uneditable custom_select_card channels_live_iframe\" data-pluginname=\"mpvideosnap\" data-headimgurl=\"https://wx.qlogo.cn/finderhead/ciaIftfPzwlqicOJrtxnwYONRbqbPYRu3uHp5YZFCC8j4wjXcEglaal8wDGnEBYEwIichrg8SniaBx8/0\" data-username=\"v2_060000231003b20faec8c4e08b11c7d3cc07e832b077b1cbb5cdd67ccd635db942f6280130ef@finder\" data-nickname=\"非凡产研\" data-desc=\"将在07月16日 09:30 直播\" data-type=\"live\" data-intro=\"智能体经济峰会｜2026非凡大赏\" data-noticeid=\"finderlivenotice-v2_060000231003b20faec8c4e08b11c7d3cc07e832b077b1cbb5cdd67ccd635db942f6280130ef@finder-1782799022871231-1569181407\" data-status=\"0\"></mp-common-videosnap></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:justify;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:#333;margin:0 0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">适合谁来：企业管理者、AI 产品负责人、AI 创业者、投资机构、产业伙伴和开发者。</span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100038403\" data-ratio=\"0.5624\" data-s=\"300,640\" type=\"block\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"3750\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=c42f071e&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2F1ZTGteQRfa3jY1AsSv0yOFCDVjgI4B87HCASlUlpxxM4bxTkbTgIUn7fQapMg3B0icBNZ3OIhiawkgHR3Xsc2FUfyYbSgCr15LcfeL227HYCc%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg\"></p>\n     <div style=\"margin:48px 0 24px;\">\n      <p style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;\"></p>\n      <h2 style=\"font-size:24px;color:#1a1a1a;margin:0;font-family:'Songti SC','SimSun',serif;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">怎么到最方便？</span></strong></h2>\n      <p></p>\n     </div>\n     <p style=\"text-align:justify;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:#333;margin:0 0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">如果坐地铁，推荐两个站：</span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:justify;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:#333;margin:0 0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">9 号线「漕河泾开发区站」3 号口，步行约 8 分钟</span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:justify;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:#333;margin:0 0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">12 号线「虹梅路站」7 号口，步行约 10 分钟</span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:justify;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:#333;margin:0 0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">从外地赶来，优先推荐上海虹桥国际机场或上海虹桥站，打车到酒店大约 30 分钟；如果坐高铁到上海南站，路程更近，打车约 20 分钟。</span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:justify;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:#333;margin:0 0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">自驾的朋友直接导航「上海漕河泾万丽酒店」即可，酒店设有停车场，收费以现场规定为准。</span></p>\n     <div style=\"margin:48px 0 24px;\">\n      <p style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;\"></p>\n      <h2 style=\"font-size:24px;color:#1a1a1a;margin:0;font-family:'Songti SC','SimSun',serif;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">到了现场，先完成这一步</span></strong></h2>\n      <p></p>\n     </div>\n     <p style=\"text-align:justify;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:#333;margin:0 0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">请提前登录「非凡大赏」小程序。</span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:justify;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:#333;margin:0 0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">签到时，使用报名时填写的手机号登录，进入小程序的「现场」页面，出示个人二维码，由工作人员扫码完成签到。领取手环后即可入场。</span></p>\n     <div style=\"background:#fffaf0;border-left:4px solid #d4a574;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin:24px 0;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align:justify;font-size:16px;line-height:1.85;color:#1a1a1a;margin:0;font-family:'Songti SC','SimSun',serif;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">有两点请特别注意：</span></strong><span leaf=\"\"> \n        <br> \n       </span><strong><span leaf=\"\">手环两天通用，请全程佩戴、不要遗失。</span></strong><span leaf=\"\"> \n        <br> \n       </span><strong><span leaf=\"\">如果登录或签到遇到问题，直接到签到处找工作人员。</span></strong></p>\n     </div>\n     <div style=\"text-align:center;margin:32px 0;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100038400\" data-ratio=\"2.5\" data-s=\"300,640\" type=\"block\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"2268\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=e7bbfbcb&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2F1ZTGteQRfa0mRG2mEr0jhyVL6XCt7Rbb6C2kDMBuTBjNpiaeM6m6Dv0jtS7ia02Ej8p7IxIicGg21KMAbWXqaqGtKfspE03RBbW8sic383EGNvM%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg%26from%3Dappmsg\"></p>\n     </div>\n     <div style=\"margin:48px 0 24px;\">\n      <p style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;\"></p>\n      <h2 style=\"font-size:24px;color:#1a1a1a;margin:0;font-family:'Songti SC','SimSun',serif;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">这次不只是\"听会\"，把现场功能也用起来</span></strong></h2>\n      <p></p>\n     </div>\n     <p style=\"text-align:justify;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:#333;margin:0 0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">很多活动结束后，大家才发现：原来身边坐着的就是想认识的人，原来照片已经能下载，原来展区打卡还有福利。</span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:justify;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:#333;margin:0 0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">这次峰会的小程序里，建议重点用好这几项功能：</span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:justify;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:#333;margin:0 0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">名片墙：提前完善个人信息，现场可以更高效地认识同行、合作伙伴和潜在客户。别等活动结束才发现\"刚才那位是谁\"。</span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:justify;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:#333;margin:0 0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">照片墙：官方摄影会记录现场精彩瞬间，活动期间可浏览、下载照片。</span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:justify;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:#333;margin:0 0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">AI 实时翻译：现场提供中英文实时翻译服务。无论是听海外嘉宾分享，还是和国际朋友交流，都能更从容一些。</span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:justify;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:#333;margin:0 0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">展位打卡：逛展位、完成互动任务后，可以领取活动福袋。每天限量 88 份，先到先得。</span></p>\n     <div style=\"margin:48px 0 24px;\">\n      <p style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;\"></p>\n      <h2 style=\"font-size:24px;color:#1a1a1a;margin:0;font-family:'Songti SC','SimSun',serif;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">福袋里有什么？</span></strong></h2>\n      <p></p>\n     </div>\n     <p style=\"text-align:justify;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:#333;margin:0 0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">完成指定数量的展位打卡，就有机会领取限量福袋。</span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:justify;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:#333;margin:0 0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">里面可能有 AI 视频工具会员或礼品卡、AI 工具优惠券和抵扣权益、办公好物，以及合作伙伴准备的品牌周边。单份福袋最高价值超过 600 元。</span></p>\n     <div style=\"background:#fffaf0;border-left:4px solid #d4a574;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin:24px 0;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align:justify;font-size:16px;line-height:1.85;color:#1a1a1a;margin:0;font-family:'Songti SC','SimSun',serif;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">\"所以别只在会场里坐着。留一点时间逛逛展区，也许能带走一个马上用得上的工具、一位值得认识的新朋友，或者一个新的合作线索。\"</span></strong></p>\n     </div>\n     <div style=\"margin:48px 0 24px;\">\n      <p style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;\"></p>\n      <h2 style=\"font-size:24px;color:#1a1a1a;margin:0;font-family:'Songti SC','SimSun',serif;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">出门前，再检查一遍</span></strong></h2>\n      <p></p>\n     </div>\n     <p style=\"text-align:justify;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:#333;margin:0 0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">7 月的上海炎热，预计气温在 30—35°C，建议这样准备：</span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:justify;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:#333;margin:0 0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">穿商务休闲装，室内空调较强，带一件薄外套</span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:justify;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:#333;margin:0 0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">带好充电宝，方便随时使用小程序</span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:justify;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:#333;margin:0 0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">随身备一把伞，应对烈日和偶发阵雨</span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:justify;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:#333;margin:0 0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">提前完善小程序中的个人名片</span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align:justify;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:#333;margin:0 0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">留意签到二维码，避免到场后手忙脚乱</span></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100038417\" data-ratio=\"6.41574074074074\" data-s=\"300,640\" type=\"block\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=993d24f8&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2F1ZTGteQRfa3QBgubr0K76ShLb1dRRj4xePuhXNBn5VEd8h3VOKj5r011zdfuos9hL93PUw6tbarw5gFvrIpoM9FAOGXCygPRDXDCldfJ4pE%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg%26from%3Dappmsg\"></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100038410\" data-ratio=\"7.580555555555556\" data-s=\"300,640\" type=\"block\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=bfb93b35&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2F1ZTGteQRfa31SVDk1zWgy6v2tgS2iacbxxJUhKomRaT96Q5qhOojJtxgntibTwVVBichicE0x4KL1G059fZBdeBGhOevAx8PyB85rSselJzDYick%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg%26from%3Dappmsg\"></p>\n     <p style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"3.599074074074074\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100038408\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=bd9b98df&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2F1ZTGteQRfa2gkTaYcpbzWSgYpdDQFkcviaL7uh1EMIXoznTh9GNYhuia28hjtiaRAxfLkePiae0UW84voXdFLrxMNmfibrFm9ox63UIDM0icDlGnc%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg%26from%3Dappmsg\"></p>\n     <div style=\"background:#fffaf0;border-left:4px solid #d4a574;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin:24px 0;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align:justify;font-size:16px;line-height:1.85;color:#1a1a1a;margin:0;font-family:'Songti SC','SimSun',serif;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">\"7 月 15 日、16 日，我们在上海漕河泾万丽酒店见。期待和你一起，在现场看见 AI 商业落地的新进展，也遇见下一位值得认真聊聊的人。\"</span></strong></p>\n     </div>\n     <div style=\"margin-top:48px;padding-top:32px;border-top:1px solid #eee;text-align:center;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100037384\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-s=\"300,640\" type=\"block\" data-w=\"1800\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=5b6781f5&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2F1ZTGteQRfa1P8aVJYMmVXhm2zgVanwnptBue5y9ia4h4Fia22alpsZqqYjQdg0D52P3dt22dwGQVsvicPygUAfIG2U7DEQ7aUr5306EGS68uMQ%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg\"></p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type data-value=\"3\"></mp-style-type></p>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "本文提供 2026 非凡大赏·上海 AI 商业峰会的时间、地点、交通、签到流程、现场功能及福袋详情，并给出参会准备建议。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "本文提供 2026 非凡大赏·上海 AI 商业峰会的时间、地点、交通、签到流程、现场功能及福袋详情，并给出参会准备建议。",
